ascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Gross margin tops the Healthcare peer set \u2014 genuine pricing power is present here","Growing faster than most Healthcare peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"What Makes Adherex Technologies (FENC) a New Strong Buy Stock","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3029730/what-makes-adherex-technologies-fenc-a-new-strong-buy-stock?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_12_zacks_rank_upgrade-3029730","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794585605.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"How Much Upside is Left in Adherex Technologies (FENC)? Wall Street Analysts Think 57.8%","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3029551/how-much-upside-is-left-in-adherex-technologies-fenc-wall-street-analysts-think-57-8?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cconsensus_price_target-3029551","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794578103.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"We're Interested To See How Fennec Pharmaceuticals (NASDAQ:FENC) Uses Its Cash Hoard To Grow","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-fenc/fennec-pharmaceuticals/news/were-interested-to-see-how-fennec-pharmaceuticals-nasdaqfenc","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794565578.931,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.402,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Fennec Pharmaceuticals Inc (FENC) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Record $19. ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/healthcare/articles/fennec-pharmaceuti